    <!-- The pre-use data declaration (Apple 5.4 / Play prominent disclosure).
         Wording is REMEDIATION-DECISIONS §1.5, audit 2026-09-29 (P0-1 / B-1 /
         D-1 / B-3). The previous text claimed "RAM-only volatile
